    p=paths[0];s=p.read_text(encoding='utf-8')
    old='Consume only the supplemental food needed for the resolved yield and actual catalyst choice; unused reserved stock returns to ordinary inventory. Reserved capacity/food cannot be pledged to simultaneous work orders. A generic failed craft with no finished food does not consume a still-unincorporated reserved supplement, but all actually incorporated inputs follow the framework\'s failure rules. Source ingredients do not become refundable merely because the supplement was not needed.'
