        s,n=re.subn(r'Reserve actual food-safe storage/serving capacity for (\d+) possible servings before rolling; existing containers are used only to their real capacity\.',r'Before rolling, predeclare actual output dispositions for all \1 possible servings: real compatible storage capacity or distinct present recipients ready to begin immediate ten-minute consumption, one simultaneous slot per recipient. Immediate servings commit at batch completion; an invalid immediate slot needs actual reserved storage or cannot use the exception. Existing containers count only to their real capacity.',s);assert n==(30 if 'PUBLIC' in p.name else 44)
        s=s.replace('This is additional to every exact ingredient. Actual food reference is 25 cp/lb,','This is additional to every exact ingredient. Reservation does not consume food; after the outcome/catalyst choice and before finished servings are created, incorporate only the actual required amount. Generic failure without a finished product leaves all supplement unincorporated; a specific failed product spends only its required supplement. Actual food reference is 25 cp/lb,')
        s=s.replace('Quality can change finite yield or dedicated mundane packaging durability; it does not improve meal potency.','Quality can change finite yield or dedicated mundane packaging durability; it does not improve meal potency. A dedicated Meal Crock first improved from maximum HP 2 to 3 gains exactly +1 current HP, preserving existing damage; an already-HP-3 crock gains neither again.')
